    {
      "id": "claim_0944785dc23e4655ac90d279034e8e06",
      "statement": "DialogHostWindow handles Escape in KeyDown (not PreviewKeyDown) so controls such as HotkeyBox can consume Escape first, routing it to DialogHostViewModel.CancelFromKeyboard; its StateChanged handler restores WindowState.Normal whenever the window maximizes with ResizeMode NoResize, which is why only LargeResizable dialogs can maximize.",
      "evidence": [
