    {
      "id": "claim_d7d55ee220a54e52a30bc8d93b39ef23",
      "statement": "Wizard mode is driven by IWizardDialogViewModel: when Content is set to a wizard, DialogHostViewModel subscribes to its PropertyChanged and mirrors IsPrimaryButtonVisible, PrimaryButtonText, IsSecondaryButtonVisible and SecondaryButtonText into the footer; WizardPrimaryCommand and WizardSecondaryCommand delegate to the wizard's commands in wizard mode but close with Confirmed/Cancelled otherwise, and CancelFromKeyboard delegates to the wizard's secondary command.",
