      "statement": "DialogSizeConstraints presets gate every dialog's size, resize and maximize behavior: XSmall 350x200, Small 380x240, Medium 600x450, Large 800x600 resizable without maximize, LargeResizable 800x600 resizable with maximize, Auto size-to-content, and Default 600x450 used when a dialog is shown with null constraints.",
