      "id": "claim_0dd295d1afee4025b8a839fd93515b05",
      "statement": "Content view models are rendered through implicit DataTemplates in Themes/DialogTemplates.xaml (merged into DialogHostWindow resources): one DataTemplate per dialog view model instantiating its Views/Dialogs/Contents UserControl, plus a sys:String template for plain-string messages; missing registration makes the ContentPresenter fall back to ToString and display the view model's type name.",
