      "id": "claim_a4a6bc8ffd364229952ce0a503bc8465",
      "statement": "Dialogs inherit theme through DialogService.PrepareWindow: theme comes from the optional themeOverride (the first-run wizard forces AppTheme.Light at startup) or from IThemeService.CurrentTheme, and IThemeService.ApplyTheme runs after the window's InitializeComponent, updating the ThemesDictionary in place, ensuring a ControlsDictionary, and swapping the Pulsar Theme.Light/Dark dictionary last so Pulsar keys win over Fluent defaults.",
